// Coal power, end to end. A boiler stands by a sump; a steam engine hangs from the roof resting on the boiler's
// top, geared through a shaft and a gear down to a belt on the floor. Three lumps of coal dropped on the boiler go
// in through its hatch and burn one at a time (40 s each). The boiler draws water out of the sump, raises steam,
// and the engine drives the belt: a stone dropped on it rides to its end. Each lump burnt leaves a lump of ash
// out of the ash door, and the third coal a lump of slag as well, as loose items on the floor. A stone dropped on
// the boiler is no fuel and stays lying on its top. The boiler, its water and its steam are saved.
map
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
#........EE*jjjjjjjjjjjj*..............#
######..................j..............#
#wwwww..................j..............#
#wwwww..................j..............#
#wwwww..................j..............#
#wwwww..............@...*>>>>>>>>>>>...#
########################################
########################################
end
give Boiler 1
place 2 -11 -2 Boiler
expect 3 boilers == 1
drop 10 Coal -13 -6
drop 20 Coal -13 -6
drop 30 Coal -13 -6
drop 30 Stone -15 -6
drop 40 Stone 7 -1
expect 60 bfuel == 3                  // all three in, one burning
expect 60 bburning == 1
expect 300 bwater > 30                // its drum filled from the sump...
expect 300 count:Water < 13           // ...and the sump went down (it had 20 tiles)
expect 300 bsteam > 10                // steam up
expect 300 turning:5,0 == 1           // the engine drives the belt
expect 300 supply:5,0 > 50
expect 300 zone:Stone,15,18,-1,0 == 1 // the stone rode to the belt's end and off it
expect 300 zone:Stone,-16,-10,-7,-5 == 1   // the other stone still lies on the boiler's top
expect 2500 items:Ash == 1            // the first lump burnt out
expect 7500 bfuel == 0                // all burnt
expect 7500 items:Ash == 3
expect 7500 items:Slag == 1
expect 7500 zone:Ash,-9,-4,-1,0 == 3  // out of the ash door, at the boiler's foot
expect 7500 turning:5,0 == 1          // the steam it raised still drives the belt
saveload 7510
expect 7511 boilers == 1
expect 7511 bsteam > 300
expect 7511 bwater > 25
